      objectReference: {fileID: 282097082}
    - target: {fileID: 1389528301241978512, guid: b005660f348248645ac5e0cf691f8b56, type: 3}
      propertyPath: forceSingleZoneCombat
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1389528301241978512, guid: b005660f348248645ac5e0cf691f8b56, type: 3}
      propertyPath: introLines.Array.size
      value: 12
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1389528301241978512, guid: b005660f348248645ac5e0cf691f8b56, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introLines.Array.data[0]'
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1389528301241978512, guid: b005660f348248645ac5e0cf691f8b56, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introLines.Array.data[1]'
      value: So you're finally here, near the end of your journey.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1389528301241978512, guid: b005660f348248645ac5e0cf691f8b56, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introLines.Array.data[2]'
      value: I've been watching over you to make sure you're on the right path.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1389528301241978512, guid: b005660f348248645ac5e0cf691f8b56, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introLines.Array.data[3]'
      value: I'm still trying to understand why you're usurping my place.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1389528301241978512, guid: b005660f348248645ac5e0cf691f8b56, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introLines.Array.data[4]'
      value: I decided to stand in your way to challenge you.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1389528301241978512, guid: b005660f348248645ac5e0cf691f8b56, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introLines.Array.data[5]'
      value: Even so, you don't seem human. People talk to you as if you were me,
        but there's nothing of me inside you, only my skin.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1389528301241978512, guid: b005660f348248645ac5e0cf691f8b56, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introLines.Array.data[6]'
      value: Do you fight and advance with the goal of getting to the bottom of this?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1389528301241978512, guid: b005660f348248645ac5e0cf691f8b56, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introLines.Array.data[7]'
      value: Are you replacing me with the mere luxury of wanting to occupy my glory?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1389528301241978512, guid: b005660f348248645ac5e0cf691f8b56, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introLines.Array.data[8]'
      value: Let's play a little game.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1389528301241978512, guid: b005660f348248645ac5e0cf691f8b56, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introLines.Array.data[9]'
      value: You and I, a playing field created to test your skills.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1389528301241978512, guid: b005660f348248645ac5e0cf691f8b56, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introLines.Array.data[10]'
      value: We'll see if you're capable of defeating the king of evil.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1389528301241978512, guid: b005660f348248645ac5e0cf691f8b56, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introLines.Array.data[11]'
      value: Lets begin
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3654578252286246093, guid: b005660f348248645ac5e0cf691f8b56, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Name
      value: BossSpawner
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
